  "description": "Novox Stacked Monogram Regular – Bold Layered Monogram Font\nNovox Stacked Monogram Regular is a bold and stylish monogram font designed with a distinctive stacked layout. This font exudes confidence and structure, perfect for creating standout initials, branding elements, logos, and personalized products. Its balanced weight and sharp edges give it a modern, professional appearance while maintaining an artistic flair.\nFeatures:\nStacked Monogram Style: Letters are arranged vertically for a clean, structured look—ideal for monograms and branding.\nModern Bold Typeface: Designed with strong lines and clear curves, making it visually impactful.\nPerfect for Personalized Projects: Use it on custom merchandise, wedding monograms, logos, business cards, and more.\nClean and Versatile: Simple yet eye-catching—suitable for both elegant and bold design styles.\nFile Formats:\nOTF (OpenType Font)\nTTF (TrueType Font)",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Novox Stacked Monogram Regular – Bold Layered Monogram Font</p>\n<p>Novox Stacked Monogram Regular is a bold and stylish monogram font designed with a distinctive stacked layout. This font exudes confidence and structure, perfect for creating standout initials, branding elements, logos, and personalized products. Its balanced weight and sharp edges give it a modern, professional appearance while maintaining an artistic flair.</p>\n<p>Features:<br>\nStacked Monogram Style: Letters are arranged vertically for a clean, structured look—ideal for monograms and branding.</p>\n<p>Modern Bold Typeface: Designed with strong lines and clear curves, making it visually impactful.</p>\n<p>Perfect for Personalized Projects: Use it on custom merchandise, wedding monograms, logos, business cards, and more.</p>\n<p>Clean and Versatile: Simple yet eye-catching—suitable for both elegant and bold design styles.</p>\n<p>File Formats:<br>\nOTF (OpenType Font)</p>\n<p>TTF (TrueType Font)</p>",
